sequenceDiagram
    actor Presenter
    participant Velero as Velero server
    participant GCS as GCS backup bucket
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API
    participant Agent as Node-agent / Kopia
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant App as KSUG.AI Aurora AI

    Presenter->>Velero: demo.sh restore BACKUP_NAME
    Velero->>GCS: Read backed-up resource definitions
    Velero->>K8s: Recreate namespace, workloads, and PVCs
    Note over K8s,Agent: New disks are provisioned for the restored PVCs
    Velero->>Agent: Restore the two backed-up volumes
    GCS->>Agent: Document files, checkpoint, and database dump
    Agent->>K8s: Write recovered volume contents
    Note over K8s,App: Velero restore-wait init containers gate application startup
    Velero-->>Presenter: Restore Completed
    Presenter->>PG: demo.sh runs pg_restore from the dump PVC
    Presenter->>App: Verify document checksums and saved history
    App-->>Presenter: Recovered state matches backup checkpoint
    Presenter->>App: Reconnect port-forward and view original conversation
